  "comments": "The difference between &quot;large&quot; coat of arms (KM# 247) and &quot;small&quot; (KM# 260) in the 1973 mintage is very hard to see in the naked eye. A better clue is to check the size of the letters, where big letters (small space between the text and the edge) would mean &quot;large coat of arms&quot;, and vice versa.<br /><br />\r\nKM# 247 Vs KM# 260:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5834b384b7be6.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5834b384b7be6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" /></a><br />\r\n© nalaberong © Ulmo<br /><br />\r\nKM# 247 Vs KM# 260:<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5834b3909d0a8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5834b3909d0a8.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\" /></a><br />\r\n© g00n © Alessandro Bentivegna Cesta",
